                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00023         * Apologies for lack of comments.
                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00024         *
                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00025         *          1986/10/01  Kevin Darling
                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00026         *
                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00027         *          1986/10/02  Kevin Darling
                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00028         * This version will do desc file on disk also.
                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00029         *
                      (l1/cmds/dmode.asm):00030         *          1989/08/24  Roger A. Krupski (HARDWAREHACK)
